/* **************************************************************************
ASWUnitTests_Win32GUI_Manifest.rc
Author: Anthony S. West - ASW Software

Embeds the Win32 GUI runner's manifest in MinGW-w64 builds (GCC and Clang),
which have no other way to embed one; MSVC and RAD Studio embed the same
.manifest file themselves. Resource 1 of type 24 is
CREATEPROCESS_MANIFEST_RESOURCE_ID of type RT_MANIFEST.

No LANGUAGE statement: GNU ld silently drops a language-neutral manifest
when another one is linked, which would drop this one in favor of the
default manifest some MinGW-w64 distributions link into every program.

Copyright 2026 ASW Software

